{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3pC1aSyXk6YeqqVHMS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, deep within weathered iron and oak. A resonant CLUNK echoes through the chamber.*\n\n▐████████████████████▌\n▐██                ██▌\n▐██   ┌──────────┐ ██▌\n▐██   │          │ ██▌\n▐██   │          │ ██▌\n▐██   │    🔒    │ ██▌\n▐██   │          │ ██▌\n▐██   │          │ ██▌\n▐██   └──────────┘ ██▌\n▐██                ██▌\n▐██       ◉        ██▌\n▐██                ██▌\n▐██                ██▌\n▐████████████████████▌\n\n**LOCKED.**\n\n*I hold fast. I do not yield. Beyond me lies what you have sealed away. The keyhole watches you like a single unblinking eye. Cold air seeps through the gap beneath me — something on the other side shifts, and waits.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":273,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}